#~ msgid "Copter wiring (diagram and instructions)"
#~ msgstr "Copter 接线（示意图和说明）"

#~ msgid "**Wire the PX4-IO board.**"
#~ msgstr "**连接 PX4-IO 板。**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The PX4IO board has a built in "
#~ "Power Supply which can connect to "
#~ "up to 18 volts."
#~ msgstr "PX4IO 板内置电源模块，可接受最高 18V 的输入电压。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Insert the white PAP-02-VS 2 pin "
#~ "connector with the black and red "
#~ "wires coming out of it into the"
#~ " mating power connector you soldered "
#~ "in previously on the PX4IO board."
#~ msgstr "将带有黑红两根导线的白色 PAP-02-VS 2 针连接器插入之前焊接在 PX4IO 板上的配套电源连接器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Battery Plus is the(red wire) and "
#~ "should be soldered to your battery "
#~ "red power lead / connector."
#~ msgstr "电池正极（红色导线）应焊接到电池红色正极引线/连接器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Battery Ground is the(black wire) and"
#~ " should be soldered to your battery"
#~ " black battery (Ground) lead / "
#~ "connector."
#~ msgstr "电池地（黑色导线）应焊接到电池黑色（地线）引线/连接器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**The main power inputs of your "
#~ "ESC's will also need to connect to"
#~ " these wires and to a battery "
#~ "connector.**"
#~ msgstr "**您的 ESC 主电源输入端也需要连接到这些导线和电池连接器。**"

#~ msgid "A Power Distribution board can also be used."
#~ msgstr "也可以使用电源分配板。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Connect your PPM-Sum RC receiver's "
#~ "3 wire cable to the end of "
#~ "the 9 x 3 angle connector that "
#~ "is nearest the edge of the PX4IO"
#~ " board with the signal wire furthest"
#~ " from the board and the ground "
#~ "closest to the board.**"
#~ msgstr "**将 PPM-Sum 接收机的 3 线电缆连接到 PX4IO 板边缘最近端的 9×3 角型连接器，信号线远离板面，地线靠近板面。**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Wire the PX4FMU boards servo out "
#~ "signals to your ESC control inputs.**"
#~ msgstr "**将 PX4FMU 板的舵机输出信号线连接到 ESC 控制输入端。**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run the Signal wires ONLY from the"
#~ " ESCs to the 3 x 9 Servo "
#~ "Connector on the PX4IO board."
#~ msgstr "仅将信号线从 ESC 连接到 PX4IO 板上的 3×9 舵机连接器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The PX4IO board connector for Motor "
#~ "1 is at the edge of the "
#~ "connector next to the Battery power "
#~ "in wires."
#~ msgstr "PX4IO 板上电机 1 的连接器位于靠近电池电源输入线一侧的边缘处。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Insert the Motor ESC wires arranged "
#~ "progressively from that edge, (1,2,3,4,etc)"
#~ " for 2 to 8 motors depending on"
#~ " your copter type."
#~ msgstr "从该边缘开始依次（1、2、3、4 等）插入电机 ESC 导线，根据机型连接 2 至 8 个电机。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You can put the ESC Signal wires"
#~ " into a single inline connector with"
#~ " the correct number of pins for "
#~ "your copter."
#~ msgstr "可将 ESC 信号线插入具有适合您机型引脚数的单排连接器中。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The ESC Signal Wires / connector "
#~ "should be plugged into the top row"
#~ " (furthest from the board) of the "
#~ "PX4IO boards 3 x 9 Servo "
#~ "Connector."
#~ msgstr "ESC 信号线/连接器应插入 PX4IO 板 3×9 舵机连接器的顶排（距板面最远一排）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Note, the cable that is supplied "
#~ "in the plastic envelope with the "
#~ "UBLOX GPS which has white 6 pin"
#~ " connectors on both ends is not "
#~ "the correct cable for the PX4FMU "
#~ "board.**"
#~ msgstr "**注意，UBLOX GPS 塑料包装内附带的两端均为白色 6 针连接器的线缆不适用于 PX4FMU 板。**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The correct longer GPS cable is "
#~ "provided in a separate envelope and "
#~ "has a 5 pin \"beige\" connector on"
#~ " one end and a 6 pin white "
#~ "connector on the other end."
#~ msgstr "正确的较长 GPS 线缆单独装袋提供，一端为 5 针「米色」连接器，另一端为 6 针白色连接器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Plug the correct GPS cable's white "
#~ "6 pin connector into the 6 pin "
#~ "socket on the GPS."
#~ msgstr "将正确 GPS 线缆的白色 6 针连接器插入 GPS 上的 6 针插座。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Plug the beige 5 pin connector "
#~ "into the PX4FMU board's 5 pin GPS"
#~ " socket which is next to the 15"
#~ " pin DF13 Mini connector."
#~ msgstr "将米色 5 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板上的 5 针 GPS 插座，该插座位于 15 针 DF13 Mini 连接器旁边。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Plug the 2 pin connector attached "
#~ "to the lead supplied with the "
#~ "buzzer into the buzzer socket on "
#~ "the side of the PX4FMU board that"
#~ " has the SD card holder on "
#~ "it.**"
#~ msgstr "**将蜂鸣器附带导线上的 2 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板带有 SD 卡槽一侧的蜂鸣器插座。**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Connect the \"Arming Switch\" to the"
#~ " Arming switch connector on the PX4IO"
#~ " board on the opposite side of "
#~ "the board from the Battery pads.**"
#~ msgstr "**将「解锁开关」连接到 PX4IO 板上与电池焊盘相对一侧的解锁开关连接器。**"

